        },
        {
          "text": "Arai kener kaŋajepa nuka ituŋa ka nuka imalaikan, kwabo emamei eoŋ amin, arai ibore yeneruo arai aisinin nueruos tai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
